Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 23:04:51 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Fixed: Preserve IME context across Korean and English
 switches

Reconcile IME edits with previously sent text, flush composition before external input, and preserve the line suffix when Enter is pressed in the middle of a command. Add regression coverage for cursor movement and newline commits.
